{
  "_id": {
    "$oid": "6abbbc91adb050288c6240dd"
  },
  "title": "A Good-Looking Website Is Not Always a Working Website",
  "slug": "good-looking-website-not-working",
  "excerpt": "A website can look professional and still fail to generate enquiries. Learn why clear content, proper structure, and SEO matter more than design alone.",
  "content": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "One thing we often notice while working with business websites is this:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ],
            "text": "The website looks good, but the business is still not getting enquiries."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The problem is usually not the design."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A customer may search for a service on Google, but if Google cannot clearly understand "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ],
            "text": "what you offer, where you provide it, and which page should appear for that search"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", your website may never reach that customer."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "For example, a business may offer five different services but explain all of them in a few lines on the homepage. To the business owner, everything looks clear. To a search engine — and sometimes even to the customer — it may not be."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This is where SEO actually starts."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Not with repeating keywords everywhere, but with making every important page answer three simple questions:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ],
            "text": "What is this page about?"
          },
          {
            "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ],
            "text": "Who is it useful for?"
          },
          {
            "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ],
            "text": "What should the visitor do next?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A website should not only look professional."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "It should help the right customer "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ],
            "text": "find you, understand you, and contact you."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "That small difference is what turns a website from an online brochure into a business tool."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "authorId": "6ab80285d9778f61fe2a2a3b",
  "authorName": "sandeep",
